WEBVTT

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:05.700
The minister who created PROUNI and granted over a million college scholarships

00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:08.000
to low-income students

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.500
will be the mayor who expands full-time schooling.

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:16.300
In the morning, students have class. In the afternoon, they go to museums, theaters, parks,

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:19.600
and play sports.

00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:23.700
He was the minister who expanded full-time education the most in Brazil.

00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:27.700
As mayor, I'll do the same for São Paulo.

00:00:27.700 --> 00:00:29.500
Think new. Vote Haddad.
